{"step_index":41,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-03T22:25:30Z","thinking":"The user is revealing a lot here. Let me parse what they said:\n\n1. They chose this niche because they saw $3,000 monthly earnings via vidIQ extension\n2. They believe AI can do EVERYTHING - research, scripts, production\n3. They have other channels that are NOT earning money\n4. They want to try this niche specifically TO earn\n5. They think they don't need to know anything because AI can handle it\n6. They want my recommendation with reasons\n\nThis is concerning. Their fundamental assumption is \"AI can do everything, I don't need to know anything, I just want money.\" This is the exact pattern that produces low-quality channels that either:\nnever get monetized due to reused content rejection, get monetized then demonetized, or get hit with copyright strikes. The fact they mention other unsuccessful channels is a red flag tooâ€”it could mean they're spreading themselves too thin or their execution quality is consistently weak. I want to be honest and keep pressing them with a few more pointed questions before giving any recommendation.","tool_calls":[{"name":"ask_question","args":{"questions":[{"is_multi_select":false,"options":["1 channel that's not earning","2-3 channels that are not earning","4+ channels, none earning properly","I'd rather not say the exact number"],"question":"You mentioned you have other channels that aren't earning. How many channels do you currently run that are making â‚¹0 or close to â‚¹0? This matters because if you can't monetize existing channels, adding another one with harder content won't fix the underlying problem."}],"toolAction":"Asking channels question","toolSummary":"Existing channels status"}}]}
